  "storyId": "act18d3_level_act18d3_08_beg",
  "groupId": "act18d3",
  "stageId": "act18d3_08",
  "title": "亲族",
  "storyCode": "SV-8",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act18d3/level_act18d3_08_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "3edd7c188b3228deb7f84c2e4c0a70ffacd562dd39dacc47a1581bad5c1d24b4",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "杂种......你们两个杂种——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "使者！你在做什么？！你为什么留住她们？她们怎么值得你这么做？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "在她们对我们同胞大肆杀戮的时候，你们就该意识到她们和你绝对不是一种东西！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "你是神圣的生命！她们只是污浊的残渣！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "（啐）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "很会适应，是不是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "我们用冷兵器去砍杀你们，让你们对技术不那么敏感，不让你们进化成其他手段也解决不了的样子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "现在我却高估你了。你太不敏感了......这都适应不了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "看起来你习惯不了阿戈尔材料学造出来的刀刃。是不是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "使者，她在侮蔑你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "主教，主教......你还看不出吗？呵呵，是的，我就是有自信杀了你。我从最开始就能杀掉你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "text": "（低鸣）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "text": "呜......（咳嗽）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "text": "兄弟，你为什么不接受？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "text": "她们都是我姐妹。所以她们也是你姐妹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "text": "我能唤起你，唤起Ishar-mla，当然......也唤起Gla-dia。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "text": "你因为你兄弟，游向浅海，就不认他，那样只是......不在乎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "text": "我们，族群，都在乎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "不......妄言......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "你难道相信过你手中经书的任何字句？允我提醒，你也是在伊比利亚的眼皮底下宣传邪说，主教。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "它说什么我都无所谓，可你，深海教会的人，是不是把他的话都用本子记下来会比较好？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "杀了他们......杀了她们！使者！动手！她们犯下了大罪！他们亵渎了你，亵渎了海洋？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "text": "你这样要求......我真会这么做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "你也无所谓，对吗？就像你和我说的一样，我这么要求也没问题！你会杀了她们！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "text": "是的。我依然无所谓。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "先去杀了那个......吟游诗人。把那个红衣服的先杀掉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "垃圾。是不是我让你去杀掉你身后的人，杀了你身后穿得像条海带的主教，你也会这么做？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "text": "是的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "......！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "text": "因为他是我同胞，你也是我同胞。他在呼唤我，你也在呼唤我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "人类啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "阿戈尔人可真是又卑劣又丑陋。承认吧，主教。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "我们都是些愚蠢的阿戈尔人，喜欢把自己的想法去套在畜生身上。你根本不懂它。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "杂种！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "只不过，如果你想保护我们的生命——为什么不拒绝？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "text": "拒绝？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "text": "怎么样......拒绝？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "行了，的确是劣等生物。你只游到这个深度。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "但是，垃圾，听好，我不会开口请你去杀你背后那个软蛋。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "你只是猎物。谁会恳求自己的猎物？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "你想动她？你听从他的建议，想杀斯卡蒂，我的猎人？你不想再要那个答案了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "text": "杀了她也有其他办法。只要还有办法，我就无所谓。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "text": "但你说的，拒绝......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "太早了。咳......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "（咳血）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "呸。我不管你。你想杀她——你得先通得过我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "text": "那么，Gla-dia。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "text": "你的生命能不能延续，你肉体以后还能不能活动，你来选能还是不能。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "用相互猎杀来选。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "text": "相互......相互。是的。用相互捕食来选。你捕食我。我捕食你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
